	Wands of digging and spells of dig should do damage to stone-type
creatures: stone giants; stone and clay golems; maybe also earth elementals,
rock trolls, and xorns. After all, they work by destroying stone, right?
(They probably should also destroy boulders in the path of the ray, too.)
Moria already has this implemented. A nifty, non-game-unbalancing feature
that Moria has, but Nethack doesn't? For shame! This must be rectified
at once!

